# iOS Session State Rule

- Derive state from persisted timestamps and current time.
- Reconcile state when app becomes active or relaunches.
- Treat app background during focus window as destabilization event.
- Never use notification fire-time as source of truth.
- Ensure reconciliation logic is idempotent and deterministic.

# Required Engineering Patterns

- Persist transition timestamps atomically.
- Inject clock/time provider for testability.
- Cover delayed notification and lifecycle churn in tests.
